{"id":"3d1afdb1d67ab49e","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_STEqBetaEta.md","title":"STEqBetaEta","display":"STEqBetaEta","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"STEqBetaEta","parameters":["B","C","k","g","t","u","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"STEqBetaEta"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>B</span><span>C</span><span>k</span><span>g</span><span>t</span><span>u</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：简单类型等式。有序参数：<code>B</code>、<code>C</code>、<code>k</code>、<code>g</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>u</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>每个中间项都有同一上下文下的同一简单类型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ STEqBetaEta B C k g t u a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z1170\n  (exists z1171\n    (exists z1172\n      (and\n        (@ Seq z1170 z1171)\n        (and\n          (@ Num0 z1172)\n          (and\n            (@ App z1170 z1172 t)\n            (and\n              (@ Last z1170 u)\n              (and\n                (forall z1173\n                  (implies (in z1173 z1171) (exists z1175 (and (@ App z1170 z1173 z1175) (@ STType B C k g z1175 a)))))\n                (forall z1173\n                  (implies\n                    (in z1173 z1171)\n                    (forall z1174\n                      (implies\n                        (and (@ Succ z1173 z1174) (in z1174 z1171))\n                        (exists z1175\n                          (exists z1176\n                            (and\n                            (@ App z1170 z1173 z1175)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App z1170 z1174 z1176)\n                            (or (= z1175 z1176) (or (@ LStepBetaEta z1175 z1176) (@ LStepBetaEta z1176 z1175)))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6f63f9693c73975a\" href=\"?note=6f63f9693c73975a\" title=\"ZFC_LStepBetaEta\">LStepBetaEta</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d72dedf3d7200b4b\" href=\"?note=d72dedf3d7200b4b\" title=\"ZFC_Last\">Last</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e8cec2782b4668b5\" href=\"?note=e8cec2782b4668b5\" title=\"ZFC_Num0\">Num0</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ed545317bea3234d\" href=\"?note=ed545317bea3234d\" title=\"ZFC_STType\">STType</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" href=\"?note=1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" title=\"ZFC_Succ\">Succ</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ STEqBetaEta B C k g t u a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_L